{"id":"652716","name":"红薯球","author":"冬季心情","authorId":"8473848","desc":"","cover":"images/652716/cover.jpeg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"红薯","amount":"60g（蒸熟）"},{"name":"水晶饺子粉","amount":"40g"},{"name":"葡萄","amount":"6颗"}],"sub":[{"name":"炼奶","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备原料。","img":"images/652716/step_1.jpeg"},{"step":2,"desc":"红薯压成泥。","img":"images/652716/step_2.jpeg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入水晶饺子粉，和成面团。","img":"images/652716/step_3.jpeg"},{"step":4,"desc":"和好的面团醒一会，葡萄去皮备用。","img":"images/652716/step_4.jpeg"},{"step":5,"desc":"面团搓长条，切小块，揉成圆形。","img":"images/652716/step_5.jpeg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅中烧开水，下红薯球煮熟捞出备用。","img":"images/652716/step_6.jpeg"},{"step":7,"desc":"红薯球中加入炼奶搅拌均匀。","img":"images/652716/step_7.jpeg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加葡萄，一碗QQ弹的红薯球做好啦。","img":"images/652716/step_8.jpeg"}],"tips":"红薯球要开水入锅煮熟。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}